  "body": "Released: 2026-09-20\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Blame reports missing or locked credentials and the corresponding recovery action instead of an invalid-response error. This applies to CLI and MCP requests.\n\n### Commits and PRs\n\n- Source commit: [c774cccb](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/c774cccb39913b5e0457deba874af20fd4390436).\n- Full diff: [v1.4.11...c774cccb](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/compare/v1.4.11...c774cccb39913b5e0457deba874af20fd4390436).\n- [#1016](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/pull/1016) — prepare the 1.4.12 patch release.\n"
